              "source": "wiktionary",
              "translation": "He is known in all Cossack lands as a knight and she he is grown in the steppe, like grass.",
              "ref": "1963, Петро́ Панч (Petró Panč), Гомоні́ла Украї́на (Homoníla Ukrajína) [Homonila Ukrayina], page 175:"
            }
          ]
        }
